            "context": "A new member can meet a helpful acquaintance today or a close relative tomorrow. The acquaintance has already offered help today; the relative has not replied. You prefer today because of the explicit offer. Acknowledge the alternative and the fact that silence does not establish unwillingness.\nFamiliar meanings available: human relationships; interpersonal; amiable; cordial; although; but; however.",
